"server>` v dialogu *Pro experty*."

#: ../channels/email/accounts/account-setup.rst:16
msgid ""
"Zammad will **send an auto-reply message to every email it imports** "
"(including the old ones!). Use the *Experts* dialog to :ref:`change this "
"behavior <archive-mode-email>` or to :doc:`disable auto-replies </manage/"
"trigger>` prior adding an email account and to turn it back on once all your "
"messages have been imported."
msgstr ""
"Zammad **pošle automatickou odpověď na každý importovaný e-mail** (včetně "
