msgid "Send mails via"
msgstr "Odesílat e-maily přes"

#: ../channels/email/accounts/account-setup.rst:218
#: ../channels/email/accounts/email-notification.rst:22
msgid "Choose from **SMTP** and **local MTA** (e.g. Sendmail)."
msgstr "Vyberte z možností **SMTP** a **místní MTA** (např. Sendmail)."

#: ../channels/email/accounts/account-setup.rst:220
msgid ""
"Local MTA (mail transfer agent) configuration is only available on self-"
"hosted installations."
msgstr ""
"Konfigurace místního MTA (mail transfer agent) je k dispozici jen u "
"instalací na vlastním serveru."

#: ../channels/email/accounts/account-setup.rst:224
#: ../channels/email/accounts/email-notification.rst:25
msgid "Your email server's hostname or IP address (e.g. ``smtp.gmail.com``)."
msgstr ""
"Název hostitele nebo IP adresa vašeho e-mailového serveru (např. "
"``smtp.gmail.com``)."

#: ../channels/email/accounts/account-setup.rst:227
#: ../channels/email/accounts/email-notification.rst:28
msgid "Your account login/username."
msgstr "Přihlašovací/uživatelské jméno vašeho účtu."

#: ../channels/email/accounts/account-setup.rst:229
#: ../channels/email/accounts/account-setup.rst:234
msgid "Leave blank to use the same value from incoming account setup."
msgstr ""
"Ponechte prázdné, chcete-li použít stejnou hodnotu jako v nastavení "
"příchozího účtu."

#: ../channels/email/accounts/account-setup.rst:237
#: ../channels/email/accounts/email-notification.rst:37
msgid "Your email server's port (usually ``587`` or ``465``)."
msgstr "Port vašeho e-mailového serveru (obvykle ``587`` nebo ``465``)."

#: ../channels/email/accounts/account-setup.rst:239
#: ../channels/email/accounts/email-notification.rst:39
msgid "Zammad will detect and enable SSL/STARTTLS support automatically."
msgstr "Zammad podporu SSL/STARTTLS rozpozná a zapne automaticky."

#: ../channels/email/accounts/account-setup.rst:251
msgid "Verification"
msgstr "Ověření"

#: ../channels/email/accounts/account-setup.rst:None
msgid "Email account verification step"
msgstr "Krok ověření e-mailového účtu"

#: ../channels/email/accounts/account-setup.rst:257
msgid ""
"As a final step, Zammad sends a test email from your own account, to your "
"own account, and to ``verify-external-smtp-sending@discard.zammad.org`` "
"which discards the test mail right away."
msgstr ""
"V posledním kroku Zammad odešle testovací e-mail z vašeho vlastního účtu na "
"váš vlastní účet a na adresu ``verify-external-smtp-"
"sending@discard.zammad.org``, která testovací e-mail okamžitě zahodí."

#: ../channels/email/accounts/account-setup.rst:261
msgid ""
"We've created a `landing page for discard.zammad.org <https://"
"discard.zammad.org>`_ which describes the backgrounds as well."
msgstr ""
"Vytvořili jsme `úvodní stránku pro discard.zammad.org <https://"
"discard.zammad.org>`_, která popisuje i podrobnosti na pozadí."

#: ../channels/email/accounts/account-setup.rst:266
msgid ""
"This this Zammad ensures that your email account is capable of sending "
"internal and external - once this is verified the setup process is complete! "
"🎉"
msgstr ""
"Tímto Zammad ověří, že váš e-mailový účet dokáže odesílat interně i externě "
"– jakmile je to ověřeno, nastavení je dokončeno! 🎉"

#: ../channels/email/accounts/account-setup-group-hint.include.rst:1
msgid ""
"If you did not assign the email address to the group, make sure to check now "
"if the correct email address is :doc:`assigned to the group </manage/groups/"
"settings>`."
msgstr ""
"Pokud jste e-mailovou adresu nepřiřadili ke skupině, zkontrolujte nyní, zda "
"je ke skupině :doc:`přiřazena správná e-mailová adresa </manage/groups/"
"settings>`."

#: ../channels/email/accounts/account-setup-group-hint.include.rst:5
msgid "Otherwise, the agents in this group will not be able to send e-mails."
msgstr "Jinak agenti v této skupině nebudou moci odesílat e-maily."

#: ../channels/email/accounts/account-setup.rst:272
