#: ../channels/email/advanced/sendmail.rst:2
msgid "Dispatch Messages With Sendmail"
msgstr "Odesílání zpráv pomocí Sendmailu"

#: ../channels/email/advanced/sendmail.rst:4
msgid ""
"If you try to configure **only** an outgoing email account (i.e. you don't "
