msgstr "Vytvoření aplikace"

#: ../channels/facebook.rst:51
msgid "Create a new app"
msgstr "Vytvořte novou aplikaci"

#: ../channels/facebook.rst:31
msgid ""
"Go to Meta's `app dashboard <https://developers.facebook.com/apps>`_ and "
