#: ../channels/microsoft365-graph/accounts.rst:8 ../misc/first-steps.rst:2
msgid "First Steps"
msgstr "První kroky"

#: ../channels/microsoft365-graph/accounts.rst:10
#: ../channels/microsoft365/accounts/register-app.rst:18
msgid ""
"Only relevant for self-hosted Zammad instances: Check your FQDN under "
"*Settings > System > Fully Qualified Domain Name* in the admin interface of "
"Zammad. If it is not correct, change it now. Otherwise the setup of the "
"channel will fail."
msgstr ""
"Týká se jen instancí Zammadu provozovaných na vlastním serveru: v "
"administraci Zammadu zkontrolujte FQDN v části *Nastavení > Systém > Plně "
"kvalifikovaný doménový název (FQDN)*. Pokud není správný, změňte ho hned "
"teď. Jinak nastavení kanálu selže."

#: ../channels/microsoft365-graph/accounts.rst:14
msgid ""
"Go to *Channels > Microsoft 365 Graph Email* and click on ``Connect "
"Microsoft 365 App``. Copy the provided callback URL."
msgstr ""
"Přejděte do *Kanály > Microsoft 365 Graph e-mail* a klikněte na ``Připojit "
"aplikaci Microsoft 365``. Zkopírujte zobrazenou URL pro zpětné volání "
"(callback)."

#: ../channels/microsoft365-graph/accounts.rst:20
msgid ""
"Go to Microsoft's `Entra admin center <https://entra.microsoft.com/#home>`_ "
"and log in as an administrator (at least application administrator "
"permission is required)."
msgstr ""
"Přejděte do `centra pro správu Microsoft Entra <https://entra.microsoft.com/"
"#home>`_ a přihlaste se jako administrátor (je potřeba alespoň role "
"Application Administrator)."

#: ../channels/microsoft365-graph/accounts.rst:25
#: ../channels/microsoft365/accounts/register-app.rst:34
msgid "Create App"
msgstr "Vytvoření aplikace"

#: ../channels/microsoft365-graph/accounts.rst:None
#: ../channels/microsoft365/accounts/register-app.rst:None
msgid ""
"Screenshot shows Entra admin center with application registration screen."
msgstr ""
"Snímek obrazovky zobrazující centrum pro správu Entra s obrazovkou "
"registrace aplikace."

#: ../channels/microsoft365-graph/accounts.rst:31
#: ../channels/microsoft365/accounts/register-app.rst:40
msgid ""
"Create a new app by going to *Applications > App registrations* and select "
"``New registration``."
msgstr ""
"Vytvořte novou aplikaci: přejděte do *Applications > App registrations* a "
"vyberte ``New registration``."

#: ../channels/microsoft365-graph/accounts.rst:33
#: ../channels/microsoft365/accounts/register-app.rst:42
msgid "Enter a fitting name and select an account type. Supported types are:"
msgstr "Zadejte vhodný název a vyberte typ účtu. Podporované typy jsou:"

#: ../channels/microsoft365-graph/accounts.rst:35
#: ../channels/microsoft365/accounts/register-app.rst:44
msgid "Accounts in this organizational directory only (single tenant)"
msgstr "Accounts in this organizational directory only (single tenant)"

#: ../channels/microsoft365-graph/accounts.rst:36
#: ../channels/microsoft365/accounts/register-app.rst:45
msgid ""
"Accounts in any organizational directory (any Microsoft Entra ID tenant, "
"multitenant)"
msgstr ""
"Accounts in any organizational directory (any Microsoft Entra ID tenant, "
"multitenant)"

#: ../channels/microsoft365-graph/accounts.rst:38
#: ../channels/microsoft365/accounts/register-app.rst:51
msgid ""
"Under **Redirect URI**, select **Web** as platform and paste your already "
"copied callback URL from Zammad."
msgstr ""
"V části **Redirect URI** vyberte jako platformu **Web** a vložte URL pro "
"zpětné volání, kterou jste zkopírovali ze Zammadu."

#: ../channels/microsoft365-graph/accounts.rst:40
#: ../channels/microsoft365/accounts/register-app.rst:53
