msgstr "Vytvoření tajného klíče"

#: ../channels/microsoft365-graph/accounts.rst:None
#: ../channels/microsoft365/accounts/register-app.rst:None
msgid "Screenshot shows Entra admin center with client secret screen."
msgstr ""
"Snímek obrazovky zobrazující centrum pro správu Entra s obrazovkou tajného "
"klíče klienta."

#: ../channels/microsoft365-graph/accounts.rst:58
#: ../channels/microsoft365/accounts/register-app.rst:62
msgid ""
"In Entra, go to **Certificates & secrets** and add a secret by clicking the "
"``New client secret`` button."
msgstr ""
"V Entra přejděte do **Certificates & secrets** a přidejte tajný klíč "
"kliknutím na tlačítko ``New client secret``."

#: ../channels/microsoft365-graph/accounts.rst:60
#: ../channels/microsoft365/accounts/register-app.rst:64
msgid "Enter a description, set an expiry duration and click ``Add``."
msgstr "Zadejte popis, nastavte dobu platnosti a klikněte na ``Add``."

#: ../channels/microsoft365-graph/accounts.rst:61
#: ../channels/microsoft365/accounts/register-app.rst:65
msgid ""
"Copy the string under **Value**, this is the secret. Paste it to Zammad in "
"the **Client Secret** field."
msgstr ""
"Zkopírujte řetězec ve sloupci **Value** – to je tajný klíč. Vložte ho v "
"Zammadu do pole **Tajný klíč klienta**."

#: ../channels/microsoft365-graph/accounts.rst:65
#: ../channels/microsoft365/accounts/register-app.rst:69
msgid ""
"Make sure to copy the **value**, not the ID. Otherwise your setup fails."
msgstr ""
"Nezapomeňte zkopírovat hodnotu (**value**), ne ID. Jinak nastavení selže."

#: ../channels/microsoft365-graph/accounts.rst:68
