"předdefinovaný webhook v Zammadu. Pokud potřebujete původní nebo nový "
"výchozí obsah (payload), najdete je níže."

#: ../manage/webhook/examples/microsoft-teams-payload.rst:10
msgid "Payload for Office Connectors (old)"
msgstr "Obsah (payload) pro konektory Office (původní)"

#: ../manage/webhook/examples/microsoft-teams-payload.rst:43
msgid "Payload for Workflows (new)"
msgstr "Obsah (payload) pro Workflows (nový)"

#: ../manage/webhook/examples/ntfy-notifications.rst:2
msgid "Ntfy Notifications"
msgstr "Oznámení ntfy"

#: ../manage/webhook/examples/ntfy-notifications.rst:4
msgid ""
"Follow the steps below to configure a webhook for sending notification via "
"`ntfy <https://ntfy.sh>`_. Have a look at their `documentation <https://"
"docs.ntfy.sh/>`_ for more information and custom configuration."
